{"verse_key": "10:41", "surah": 10, "verse": 41, "text_uthmani": "وَإِن كَذَّبُوكَ فَقُل لِّى عَمَلِى وَلَكُمْ عَمَلُكُمْ ۖ أَنتُم بَرِيٓـُٔونَ مِمَّآ أَعْمَلُ وَأَنَا۠ بَرِىٓءٌ مِّمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "And if they deny you, [O Muḥammad], then say, \"For me are my deeds, and for you are your deeds. You are disassociated from what I do, and I am disassociated from what you do.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1013110, "verse_to_ms": 1036780, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَإِن", "start_ms": 1013110, "end_ms": 1014650}, {"i": 1, "text": "كَذَّبُوكَ", "start_ms": 1014650, "end_ms": 1015870}, {"i": 2, "text": "فَقُل", "start_ms": 1015870, "end_ms": 1016410}, {"i": 3, "text": "لِّى", "start_ms": 1016410, "end_ms": 1016850}, {"i": 4, "text": "عَمَلِى", "start_ms": 1016850, "end_ms": 1017630}, {"i": 5, "text": "وَلَكُمْ", "start_ms": 1017630, "end_ms": 1018480}, {"i": 6, "text": "عَمَلُكُمْ", "start_ms": 1018480, "end_ms": 1020400}, {"i": 7, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1020400, "end_ms": 1022580}, {"i": 8, "text": "أَنتُم", "start_ms": 1022580, "end_ms": 1024920}, {"i": 9, "text": "بَرِيٓـُٔونَ", "start_ms": 1024920, "end_ms": 1027630}, {"i": 10, "text": "مِمَّآ", "start_ms": 1027630, "end_ms": 1028410}, {"i": 11, "text": "أَعْمَلُ", "start_ms": 1028410, "end_ms": 1029000}, {"i": 12, "text": "وَأَنَا۠", "start_ms": 1029000, "end_ms": 1031180}, {"i": 13, "text": "بَرِىٓءٌ", "start_ms": 1031180, "end_ms": 1033220}, {"i": 14, "text": "مِّمَّا", "start_ms": 1033220, "end_ms": 1036275}, {"i": 15, "text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}